    "long_instructions": "## Generate a Parameterized Function\r\nUpdate the `addShirt() function to include parameters so it displays the correct shirt when a shirt button is clicked.\r\n\r\n1. **Plan**\r\n   - Use the table in your Unit Guide to write a prompt in `prompt.md`.\r\n\r\n2. **Build**\r\n   - Send the function to AI Tutor and use your prompt to generate code.\r\n\r\n4. **Test**\r\n   - Click the shirt **+ buttons**.\r\n   - Does the output change based on which shirt you clicked?",
