      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildJavaScript": "Only modify the shirt-related behavior in this level.\n\nRequirements:\n- Create or update a function that handles shirts only.\n- The function should display the correct shirt when a shirt button is clicked.\n- Use parameters so different shirt buttons can pass in different values.\n- Do not create a general function for all items.\n- Do not modify jacket behavior.\n- Do not change jacket event listeners or add parameters for jackets.\n- Keep the solution focused on shirts only.\n- Keep the code simple and aligned to the existing pattern in the file.\n\n- Do not rename or redesign this as a general add-to-cart system.\n- Do not make the function work for jackets or other item types.\n- This level should leave non-shirt items unchanged."
      }
    },
